Patch List:
   * Fix anonymous bit-fields with qualifiers.
   * Rename DAC EMPTY bit-fields to DBEMPTY to avoid collision with Zephyr macros.
   * SAMD21G17D: rename the samd21d component/evsys.h, component/nvmctrl.h,
     component/pm.h, component/tcc.h, instance/evsys.h, instance/nvmctrl.h
     and instance/port.h to *_variant_d.h, since they differ from the
     samd21a files of the same name.
   * SAMD21G17D: rename NonMaskableInt_Handler and SVCall_Handler to
     NMI_Handler and SVC_Handler, matching the other samd21 headers.
